  "label": "Leather Jacket and Studded Gloves as Edgy Fashion",
  "description": "Leather jackets and studded gloves are fashion items often associated with rebellion, toughness, and edginess — typically linked to punk, rock, or streetwear subcultures. Their inclusion in the image, paired with a hijab and Nike sweatshirt, creates a juxtaposition that challenges traditional gender and cultural norms. The background knowledge required is the cultural meaning of these items — they are not just clothing but symbols of attitude and defiance, which the meme uses to reinforce the woman’s confidence and modernity.",
